{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "R2 SaaS Base API",
    "description": "Postman collection generated from `api/Presentation/Http/Routes/web.php`.\n\n**Auth**\n- `x-token` — API credential (env `X_TOKEN`), required by GlobalApiMiddleware\n- `x-user-token` — user session token (`user.token` from login/register), required by GlobalApiAuthMiddleware\n- Admin routes also require an authenticated user whose `role` contains `admin`\n\n**Recent routes**\n- `POST /v2/snappy-orders/{orderId}/unassign-from-batch` — admin clear order batch\n- `GET /v2/logs/migrate` — migrate logs table\n- `GET /v2/logs` — admin list logs (`type`, `search`, `id`)\n\nSet collection variables `baseUrl`, `xToken`, and `xUserToken` after login.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:2020" },
    { "key": "xToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "xUserToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "walletId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "batchId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "threadId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "agentId", "value": "1" },
