    {
      "name": "Auth (Admin)",
      "description": "Requires `x-token` + `x-user-token` and an admin role (`GlobalApiAuthAdminMiddleware`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Users",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  var users = json.data && json.data.users ? json.data.users : (json.users || []);",
                  "  if (Array.isArray(users) && users.length > 0 && users[0].id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(users[0].id));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-token", "value": "{{xToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-user-token", "value": "{{xUserToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/auth/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v2", "auth", "users"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Matches name, email, phone, or role (LIKE)" },
                { "key": "email", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Exact email match" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /v2/auth/users\n\nAdmin only (`UserController::fetch` → `fetchUsersAsAdmin`).\n\nSuccess shape:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"users\": [/* UserEntity[] */],\n    \"count\": 0,\n    \"message\": \"Users fetched successfully\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOptional query filters: `search`, `email`.\nOn success, sets `userId` from the first returned user."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wallet",
      "description": "Requires `x-token` + `x-user-token`.\n\nThese wallet routes run `WalletFeedbackMiddleware` before the controller: pending online top-ups are verified with Paystack; results are logged (`title: wallet_feedback`) and available via admin `GET /v2/logs`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Top Up Online",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-token", "value": "{{xToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-user-token", "value": "{{xUserToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 100\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/wallet/top-up-online",
            "description": "Creates a pending online top-up and returns a Paystack `payment_url` on the wallet.\n\nRequest JSON: `{ \"amount\": 100 }`\n\nSuccess shape:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"wallet\": {\n      \"id\": 5,\n      \"user_id\": 31,\n      \"reference\": \"TOPUP-…\",\n      \"type\": \"online\",\n      \"amount\": 100,\n      \"balance\": 0,\n      \"description\": \"Top up online\",\n      \"payment_url\": \"https://checkout.paystack.com/…\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-09 03:43:35\"\n    },\n    \"message\": \"Top up online successful\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOpen `data.wallet.payment_url` to complete payment. Balance stays `0` / status `pending` until Paystack confirms."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Top Up Manual",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-token", "value": "{{xToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-user-token", "value": "{{xUserToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 100,\n  \"proof_of_payment_screenshot1\": \"\",\n  \"proof_of_payment_screenshot2\": \"\",\n  \"proof_of_payment_screenshot3\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v2/wallet/top-up-manual"
          }
        },
        {
